{"id": "systems/runes-and-stars", "type": "systems", "slug": "runes-and-stars", "title": "Runes and stars", "summary": "Runes (12 kinds, 6 rarities, from dungeon guardians) engraved at the Rune Temple, and up to 5 stars on weapons and armors for +4% of their stats each in dungeons.", "rarity": null, "is_overview": false, "image": null, "infobox": [], "sections": [{"id": "runes", "heading": "Runes", "blocks": [{"type": "ul", "text": "Runes drop only from dungeon guardians : each awakened there rolls (12% in a rank E dungeon up to 35% in a Nation one, x1.5 in a guild raid); a higher rank's dungeon gives rarer runes. Odds: rune drops and rune rarity . At the altar of the Rune Temple , engrave a rune into a weapon, armor or pendant that it fits. One rune per item: a new one replaces the old one (lost). The item is then bound for a while: it cannot be worn, sold, traded or forged. Once free, the rune works while the item is worn. Skip the binding with shards (per hour left) or Robux, or with a binding skip bought from the traveling merchant .", "html": "<ul> <li>Runes drop <strong>only from dungeon guardians</strong>: each awakened there rolls (12% in a rank E dungeon up to 35% in a Nation one, x1.5 in a guild raid); a higher rank's dungeon gives rarer runes. Odds: <a href=\"/en/w/overrank/odds#rune-drop\">rune drops</a> and <a href=\"/en/w/overrank/odds#rune-rarity\">rune rarity</a>.</li> <li>At the altar of the <a href=\"/en/w/overrank/places/rune-temple\">Rune Temple</a>, engrave a rune into a <strong>weapon, armor or pendant</strong> that it fits. One rune per item: a new one replaces the old one (lost).</li> <li>The item is then <strong>bound</strong> for a while: it cannot be worn, sold, traded or forged. Once free, the rune works while the item is worn.</li> <li>Skip the binding with shards (per hour left) or Robux, or with a binding skip bought from the <a href=\"/en/w/overrank/systems/traveling-merchant\">traveling merchant</a>.</li> </ul>"}]}, {"id": "the-12-ru