rmor, pendant</td></tr><tr><td><img alt=\"Rune of Focus\" src=\"/games/overrank/runes/focus.webp\"/></td><td><strong>Rune of Focus</strong></td><td>skill cooldowns (less)</td><td>0.6%</td><td>3%</td><td>pendant</td></tr><tr><td><img alt=\"Rune of Arcana\" src=\"/games/overrank/runes/arcana.webp\"/></td><td><strong>Rune of Arcana</strong></td><td>max mana</td><td>1.5%</td><td>7.5%</td><td>pendant</td></tr><tr><td><img alt=\"Rune of Wisdom\" src=\"/games/overrank/runes/wisdom.webp\"/></td><td><strong>Rune of Wisdom</strong></td><td>XP</td><td>1%</td><td>5%</td><td>pendant</td></tr></tbody></table>"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Each rarity multiplies the rune's base: Common x1, Uncommon x1.5, Rare x2, Epic x3, Legendary x4, Mythic x5.", "html": "<p>Each rarity multiplies the rune's base: Common x1, Uncommon x1.5, Rare x2, Epic x3, Legendary x4, Mythic x5.</p>"}]}, {"id": "rarities-and-binding", "heading": "Rarities and binding", "blocks": [{"type": "table", "headers": ["Rarity", "Value", "Binding", "Skip (shards per hour left)", "Skip (Robux)"], "rows": [[{"text": "Common"}, {"text": "x1"}, {"text": "10 min"}, {"text": "400 (60 at least)"}, {"text": "5 R$"}], [{"text": "Uncommon"}, {"text": "x1.5"}, {"text": "30 min"}, {"text": "600 (120 at least)"}, {"text": "10 R$"}], [{"text": "Rare"}, {"text": "x2"}, {"text": "1 h"}, {"text": "900 (250 at least)"}, {"text": "20 R$"}], [{"text": "Epic"}, {"text": "x3"}, {"text": "2 h"}, {"text": "1,400 (500 at least)"}, {"text": "35 R$"}], [{"text": "Legendary"}, {"text": "x4"}, {"text": "3 h 30"}, {"text": "2,200 (900 at least)"}, {"text": "60 R$"}], [{"text": "Mythic"}, {"text": "x5"}, {"text": "5 h"}, {"text": "3,200 (1,500 at least)"}, {"text": "99 R$"}]], "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>Rarity</th><th>Value</th><th>Binding</th><th>Skip (shards per hour left)</th><th>Skip (Robux)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Common</td><td>x1</td><td>10 min</td><td>400 (60 at least)</td><td>5 R$</td></tr><tr><td>Uncommon</td><td>x1.5</td><td>30 min</td><td>600 (120 at least)</td><td>10 R$</td></tr><tr><td>Rare</td><td>x2</td><td>1 h</td><td>900 (250 at least)</td><td>20 R$</td></tr><tr><td>Epic</td><td>x3</td><td>2 h</td><td>1,400 (500 at least)</td><td>35 R$</td></tr><tr><td>Legendary</td><td>x4</td><td>3 h 30</td><td>2,200 (900 at least)</td><td>60 R$</td></tr><tr><td>Mythic</td><td>x5</td><td>5 h</td><td>3,200 (1,500 at least)</td><td>99 R$</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"id": "stars", "heading": "Stars", "blocks": [{"type": "ul", "text": "Up to 5 stars on a weapon or an armor (not on pendants), added at the forge (STARS). Each star gives the item +4% of its own stats, inside dungeons only (+20% with 5 stars). Stars cost essences : every dungeon boss you help defeat gives some (more for a higher rank); the traveling merchant sells some too.", "html": "<ul> <li>Up to <strong>5 stars</strong> on a weapon or an armor (not on pendants), added at the forge (STARS).</li> <li>Each star gives the item <strong>+4% of its own stats, inside dungeons only</strong> (+20% with 5 stars).</li> <li>Stars cost <strong>essences</strong>: every dungeon boss you help defeat gives some (more for a higher rank); the traveling merchant sells some too.</li> </ul>"}, {"type": "table", "headers": ["Star", "1", "2", "3", "4", "5"], "rows": [[{"text": "Essences"}, {"text": "60"}, {"text": "180"}, {"text": "450"}, {"text": "1,100"}, {"text": "2,600"}]], "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>Star</th><th>1</th><th>2</th><th>3</th><th>4</th><th>5</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Essences</td><td>60</td><td>180</td><td>450</td><td>1,100</td><td>2,600</td></tr></tbody></table>"}, {"type": "table", "headers": ["Boss rank", "E", "D", "C", "B", "A", "S", "S+", "Nation"], "rows": [[{"text": "Essences"}, {"text": "1"}, {"text": "2"}, {"text": "3"}, {"text": "5"}, {"text": "8"}, {"text": "12"}, {"text": "18"}, {"text": "25"}]], "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>Boss rank</th><th>E</th><th>D</th><th>C</th><th>B</th><th>A</th><th>S</th><th>S+</th><th>Natio